  "$comment": [
    "Tier-3 spec for v4's generateEmbeddingForUser (P4.1a deliverable 4 — the",
    "API-path EmbeddingProvider). One committed file drives BOTH sides:",
    "  - the fixture builder (build-embedding-provider-fixture.ts) seeds",
    "    embedding_profiles / api_keys / tfidf_vocabularies through v4's REAL repos,",
    "  - the v4 oracle (embedding-provider-tier3.test.ts) runs the cases with",
    "    global.fetch mocked to each case's `wire` script (which also intercepts",
    "    the bundled OpenRouter SDK), recording the exact requests + results,",
    "  - the Rust harness (embedding_provider_tier3_equivalence) replays the same",
    "    calls over a CannedWireTransport registered FROM the oracle-recorded wire",
    "    (a Rust request-building divergence = canned miss).",
    "",
    "The BUILTIN default profile's vocabulary is fitted by v4's REAL",
    "TfIdfVectorizer over `tfidfCorpus` at fixture-build time, so both sides load",
    "identical stored bytes (no ln computed at query time — exact compare).",
    "",
    "userB is deliberately NEVER seeded (the no-profiles case). The",
    "missing-api-key profile points at an api_keys id that is never created; the",
    "explicit-missing case passes `missingProfileId`, which no profile carries.",
    "",
    "SAFETY: testPepperBase64 is a THROWAWAY 32-byte key (shared with the other",
    "fixtures); every api key value is SYNTHETIC."
  ],
